{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37166","headline":"枯木诗辞召命作 · 翁洮","name":"枯木诗辞召命作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枯木傍溪崖，由来岁月赊。\n有根盘水石，无叶接烟霞。\n二月苔爲色，三冬雪作花。\n不因星使至，谁识是灵槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁洮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}